  "solution_html": "Le nombre choisi au départ est \\(-10\\) car\t<p>\t<ul><li>On choisit un nombre&nbsp;:\\(-10\\)</li>\t                  <li>On ajoute \\(-7\\)&nbsp;:\\(-10 - 7 = -17\\)</li>\t                  <li>On obtient bien <span class=\"nowrap\">\\(-17\\).</span></li></ul> Pour aller plus loin, on peut essayer de trouver le nombre manquant par un calcul en observant le schéma suivant&nbsp;:<br>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"><svg width=\"135\" height=\"40\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 101.00 30.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<g id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(4 26)\">\n<title>bar</title>\n<polygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"transparent\" points=\"-4,4 -4,-26 97,-26 97,4 -4,4\"/>\n\n<g id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n<title>1</title>\n<polygon fill=\"none\" stroke=\"blue\" points=\"14,-14 0,-14 0,0 14,0 14,-14\"/>\n<text fill=\"#000000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"7\" y=\"-4.5\" font-family=\"Times,serif\" font-size=\"10.00\">?</text>\n</g>\n\n<g id=\"node2\" class=\"node\">\n<title>2</title>\n<polygon fill=\"none\" stroke=\"blue\" points=\"93,-14 79,-14 79,0 93,0 93,-14\"/>\n<text fill=\"#000000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"86\" y=\"-4.5\" font-family=\"Times,serif\" font-size=\"10.00\">&#45;17</text>\n</g>\n\n<g id=\"edge1\" class=\"edge\">\n<title>1&#45;&gt;2</title>\n<path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"blue\" d=\"M14.04,-7C25.68,-7 51.56,-7 68.64,-7\"/>\n<polygon fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" points=\"68.77,-10.5 78.77,-7 68.77,-3.5 68.77,-10.5\"/>\n<text fill=\"#000000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"46.5\" y=\"-10.8\" font-family=\"Times,serif\" font-size=\"14.00\">+(&#45;7)</text>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></div>\tet trouver le nombre de départ en inversant le chemin&nbsp;:\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"><svg width=\"135\" height=\"59\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 101.00 44.06\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<g id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(4 40.06)\">\n<title>bar</title>\n<polygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"transparent\" points=\"-4,4 -4,-40.06 97,-40.06 97,4 -4,4\"/>\n\n<g id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n<title>1</title>\n<polygon fill=\"none\" stroke=\"blue\" points=\"14,-28.06 0,-28.06 0,-14.06 14,-14.06 14,-28.06\"/>\n<text fill=\"#000000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"7\" y=\"-18.56\" font-family=\"Times,serif\" font-size=\"10.00\">?</text>\n</g>\n\n<g id=\"node2\" class=\"node\">\n<title>2</title>\n<polygon fill=\"none\" stroke=\"blue\" points=\"93,-28.06 79,-28.06 79,-14.06 93,-14.06 93,-28.06\"/>\n<text fill=\"#000000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"86\" y=\"-18.56\" font-family=\"Times,serif\" font-size=\"10.00\">&#45;17</text>\n</g>\n\n<g id=\"edge2\" class=\"edge\">\n<title>1&#45;&gt;2</title>\n<path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"blue\" d=\"M14.04,-21.06C25.68,-21.06 51.56,-21.06 68.64,-21.06\"/>\n<polygon fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" points=\"68.77,-24.56 78.77,-21.06 68.77,-17.56 68.77,-24.56\"/>\n<text fill=\"#000000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"46.5\" y=\"-24.86\" font-family=\"Times,serif\" font-size=\"14.00\">+(&#45;7)</text>\n</g>\n\n<g id=\"edge1\" class=\"edge\">\n<title>2&#45;&gt;1</title>\n<path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"blue\" d=\"M78.94,-14.74C74.45,-10.53 67.92,-5.36 61,-3.06 48.77,1.02 44.23,1.02 32,-3.06 28.43,-4.25 24.97,-6.2 21.83,-8.38\"/>\n<polygon fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" points=\"19.58,-5.7 14.06,-14.74 24.01,-11.12 19.58,-5.7\"/>\n<text fill=\"#000000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"46.5\" y=\"-6.86\" font-family=\"Times,serif\" font-size=\"14.00\">&#45;(&#45;7)</text>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></div>\tdonc en effectuant le calcul&nbsp;:\\(? = -17 - -7\\)<p>\\(?=(-17)\\plus(+7)\\)<p>\\(? = -10\\)</p></p>",
